WEBVTT

00:00:01.615 --> 00:00:13.493
Yes, I embraced tenderness and devotion
sou itooshisa to kizuna wo daita

00:00:13.627 --> 00:00:19.199
Floating in unending space
hatenaki umi ni ukabu

00:00:19.199 --> 00:00:26.105
On this small planet
chiisa na hoshi de

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:37.642
When I feel your warmth next to me
anata no nukumori wo soba ni kanjiru toki

00:00:37.851 --> 00:00:43.790
I understand the burden
inochi no omosa to

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:51.196
And the transience of life
hakanasa wo shiru no

00:00:53.934 --> 00:00:59.005
Nights of sorrowful wandering
mayoinageku yoru mo

00:00:59.005 --> 00:01:05.879
And tearful mornings
namida no asa mo

00:01:05.879 --> 00:01:11.485
I believe in tomorrow
ashita wo shinjiru kara

00:01:11.485 --> 00:01:17.724
So I can make it through
koeteyukeru no

00:01:17.724 --> 00:01:26.189
To the continuation of the dream
yume no tsuzuki he

00:01:32.706 --> 00:01:39.546
At the bottom of the deep, clear sea

00:01:39.546 --> 00:01:42.649
TINA
At the bottom of the deep, clear sea

00:01:42.649 --> 00:01:44.518
TINA
A small flower is resting

00:01:44.518 --> 00:01:52.584
A small flower is resting

00:01:52.826 --> 00:02:01.632
The melody of a gentle wind
passes through a rainbow

00:02:02.803 --> 00:02:11.438
The fish are playing in the sky

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:16.113
That song...

00:02:18.118 --> 00:02:21.315
It's a lullaby that my mother
always used to sing to me.

00:02:23.056 --> 00:02:25.115
Aren't you worried, Soreto?

00:02:26.393 --> 00:02:29.796
Ever since I was little,
my mother told me that

00:02:29.796 --> 00:02:35.166
I was sure to become a great scientist
whose work would benefit the people.

00:02:37.103 --> 00:02:40.698
But I wonder if the research
we're doing now really does.

00:02:40.807 --> 00:02:42.707
Aghi...

00:02:43.543 --> 00:02:48.548
I've come this far with you
because I believe in you, Aghi.

00:02:48.548 --> 00:02:51.346
So, please don't say things
like that.

00:02:51.451 --> 00:02:53.351
That's true.

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:57.347
King Titus should be arriving.
Let's go, Soreto.

00:03:18.979 --> 00:03:20.776
Father!

00:03:21.248 --> 00:03:24.484
I see. So you're saying that
utilization of Orsel energy is

00:03:24.484 --> 00:03:26.253
close at hand, correct?

00:03:26.253 --> 00:03:29.814
That is very good news, Palza.

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:31.489
Yes.

00:03:32.526 --> 00:03:35.128
Greecia has an abundance of water,

00:03:35.128 --> 00:03:36.930
but if you look to the future

00:03:36.930 --> 00:03:40.133
and consider the energy needs
of the whole country,

00:03:40.133 --> 00:03:44.304
we must make the development of
an alternative energy source a reality.

00:03:44.304 --> 00:03:46.473
Thank you very much, Your Majesty.

00:03:46.473 --> 00:03:48.708
By the way, Palza, Mel...

00:03:48.708 --> 00:03:52.679
We've heard that you two
will be getting married soon.

00:03:52.679 --> 00:03:54.408
Uh, no...

00:03:55.549 --> 00:03:57.141
Yes.

00:03:59.152 --> 00:04:01.354
Is that right?
Then congratulations are in order!

00:04:01.354 --> 00:04:04.224
It will soon be my
tomboy's turn, too.

00:04:04.224 --> 00:04:07.352
Oh, no... I forgot!

00:04:07.494 --> 00:04:11.624
My daughter said she had something
important to tell me but...

00:04:11.898 --> 00:04:13.867
Well, that will never do.

00:04:13.867 --> 00:04:17.771
If you make Princess Tina angry,
she won't let you off so easily!

00:04:17.771 --> 00:04:20.137
Don't scare me, Gotto.

00:04:24.778 --> 00:04:27.212
That came from the direction
of the royal chambers!

00:04:38.825 --> 00:04:41.089
What was that sound?

00:04:49.569 --> 00:04:50.770
That's the king's room!

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:52.635
The princess!

00:04:52.772 --> 00:04:54.797
The princess!

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:03.938
Tina!!

00:05:07.220 --> 00:05:11.054
You're supposed to be a palace
guard! What were you doing?!

00:05:11.257 --> 00:05:12.959
Tina was...

00:05:12.959 --> 00:05:16.062
Tina was caught in by a bomb
planted in the royal chamber!

00:05:16.062 --> 00:05:18.098
-Tina!
-Stop!

00:05:18.098 --> 00:05:21.835
Even if you go to her now,
there's nothing you can do to help.

00:05:21.835 --> 00:05:24.104
She's being treated by the
doctors now.

00:05:24.104 --> 00:05:27.665
If anything happens to Tina,
I will never forgive you!

00:05:30.677 --> 00:05:32.440
Seth...

00:05:32.979 --> 00:05:35.675
I'm a failure as a palace guard.

00:05:36.116 --> 00:05:38.414
It's all my fault.

00:05:41.421 --> 00:05:43.286
Soran...

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:48.962
I spoke out of turn.

00:05:48.962 --> 00:05:50.520
I'm sorry.

00:06:05.045 --> 00:06:09.482
I'm sorry, but in this condition...

00:06:11.017 --> 00:06:15.555
If you dare say even one more word,

00:06:15.555 --> 00:06:19.184
I'll tear you to pieces.

00:06:19.592 --> 00:06:22.362
Get out of my sight!
You brainless fools!

00:06:22.362 --> 00:06:25.229
Get out! Get out!

00:07:00.200 --> 00:07:02.402
King Titus!

00:07:02.402 --> 00:07:05.565
Open the Zone.

00:07:08.007 --> 00:07:10.567
I won't accept this.

00:07:11.578 --> 00:07:16.675
That adorable Tina
can't possibly be dead.

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:19.319
Listen to me.

00:07:19.319 --> 00:07:23.847
Use your power to save
my darling princess...

00:07:24.190 --> 00:07:26.886
To save Tina!

00:07:27.560 --> 00:07:31.360
The same way you brought
that marmot back to life.

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:36.992
Please save my only daughter!

00:07:40.807 --> 00:07:43.409
We understand your feelings,
King Titus.

00:07:43.409 --> 00:07:44.911
But...

00:07:44.911 --> 00:07:47.947
Princess Tina is different
from a marmot.

00:07:47.947 --> 00:07:51.851
Reviving a body with a human soul
transferred into it isn't possible yet.

00:07:51.851 --> 00:07:55.221
I beseech you!
You all know...

00:07:55.221 --> 00:07:59.025
She's my... my darling,
only daughter!

00:07:59.025 --> 00:08:02.362
No matter what happens,
it will be my responsibility!

00:08:02.362 --> 00:08:04.864
As the king,
I give you permission!

00:08:04.864 --> 00:08:06.232
I beseech you!

00:08:06.232 --> 00:08:09.224
But that would not be the best thing
for Princess Tina.

00:08:10.370 --> 00:08:12.472
Please calm down, Your Majesty.

00:08:12.472 --> 00:08:14.908
Because reviving a human body
is an unexplored area,

00:08:14.908 --> 00:08:16.773
-we don't know what...
-Silence!

00:08:16.810 --> 00:08:19.245
-Silence!
-Palza!

00:08:19.245 --> 00:08:21.581
This is an order!
Don't you understand?!

00:08:21.581 --> 00:08:23.650
The princess's life is
slipping away!

00:08:23.650 --> 00:08:25.885
Tina is my life!

00:08:25.885 --> 00:08:29.446
If you people can't do it,
I'll make it work!

00:08:49.142 --> 00:08:51.633
I understand.

00:08:53.313 --> 00:08:55.481
The amount of artificial matter
is barely enough.

00:08:55.481 --> 00:08:57.450
There might not be enough to
reconstruct a human being.

00:08:57.450 --> 00:08:59.152
Put in everything we have
stored in reserve!

00:08:59.152 --> 00:09:01.254
I've put in all of it!
That's everything we have!

00:09:01.254 --> 00:09:03.690
Orsel intensity is 570 Stilpe!

00:09:03.690 --> 00:09:06.158
730... 820...

00:09:07.961 --> 00:09:10.096
Cessation of Princess Tina's
heart functions...

00:09:10.096 --> 00:09:11.893
Confirmed!

00:09:49.435 --> 00:09:51.630
Tina...

00:09:56.409 --> 00:10:00.072
My Tina... Tina...

00:10:04.617 --> 00:10:06.252
The data we've taken shows

00:10:06.252 --> 00:10:09.155
that Princess Tina's spirit wave pattern
is exactly the same as it was before.

00:10:09.155 --> 00:10:11.090
I see. I see.

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:15.322
You've all done well.
You've done well.

00:10:27.106 --> 00:10:28.801
And now...

00:10:29.776 --> 00:10:33.177
I have one more request
for all of you.

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:39.552
Wasn't the princess seriously injured?

00:10:39.552 --> 00:10:42.288
I heard that the doctors had
given up on her, but...

00:10:42.288 --> 00:10:45.689
Look! Princess Tina looks
perfectly healthy, doesn't she?

00:10:46.759 --> 00:10:48.954
Princess Tina...

00:10:56.970 --> 00:10:58.671
Don't worry, Soran.

00:10:58.671 --> 00:11:00.773
She's only just recovered
so I haven't talked to Tina,

00:11:00.773 --> 00:11:02.075
but she looked well.

00:11:02.075 --> 00:11:03.943
-Really?
-Yes.

00:11:03.943 --> 00:11:07.013
I see. That's great.

00:11:07.013 --> 00:11:09.182
That's really great.

00:11:09.182 --> 00:11:13.186
The two suspected culprits died
in a cottage in the woods.

00:11:13.186 --> 00:11:14.887
They were silenced?

00:11:14.887 --> 00:11:17.287
Who could have done this?

00:11:23.162 --> 00:11:25.331
Is it really a success?

00:11:25.331 --> 00:11:26.733
It's perfect.

00:11:26.733 --> 00:11:29.102
Everyone thinks she's the
real princess.

00:11:29.102 --> 00:11:32.205
No, it's the truth. She's no different
from the real Princess Tina.

00:11:32.205 --> 00:11:34.207
Isn't that right, Aghi?

00:11:34.207 --> 00:11:36.075
The spirit wave pattern record

00:11:36.075 --> 00:11:40.102
made skin and internal organs exactly
the same as those of our bodies.

00:11:40.246 --> 00:11:44.617
And the soul in the body is
definitely Princess Tina herself.

00:11:44.617 --> 00:11:46.686
No one could possibly notice.

00:11:46.686 --> 00:11:48.821
She will slowly grow older,

00:11:48.821 --> 00:11:50.957
and depending on the life span
of the body her soul is in,

00:11:50.957 --> 00:11:53.187
she will live out her life.

00:11:53.493 --> 00:11:54.961
But...

00:11:54.961 --> 00:11:57.063
Someday we will have to
tell Princess Tina.

00:11:57.063 --> 00:11:59.463
No! Absolutely not!

00:11:59.665 --> 00:12:02.602
We can't let the princess suffer
anymore than she already has!

00:12:02.602 --> 00:12:06.436
This will be a secret between
just the seven of us here forever!

00:12:09.142 --> 00:12:12.009
What about the mechanism
installed in her body?

00:12:12.478 --> 00:12:15.248
We'll wait until the time is right
and secretly remove it.

00:12:15.248 --> 00:12:17.650
When the princess goes in for
a check-up or something.

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:20.787
But even though it was
the king's orders,

00:12:20.787 --> 00:12:24.223
putting an operating mechanism
in the princess's body...

00:12:24.424 --> 00:12:26.392
What are you talking about?!

00:12:27.093 --> 00:12:29.857
Is what you just said true?!

00:12:40.006 --> 00:12:45.137
Then the princess actually died,
didn't she?

00:12:45.812 --> 00:12:49.715
That is... That princess is...

00:12:49.715 --> 00:12:52.085
A fake?

00:12:52.085 --> 00:12:53.653
And not only that,

00:12:53.653 --> 00:12:57.490
she's a weapon that
uses Orsel energy.

00:12:57.490 --> 00:12:59.720
That's what you're saying, right?!

00:13:00.993 --> 00:13:03.518
I have one request.

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:06.666
If Tina should again be
subjected to

00:13:06.666 --> 00:13:09.726
the same kind of sadness and
suffering, when it happens...

00:13:10.403 --> 00:13:13.600
Then as King of Greecia, my...

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:18.111
Titus's anger shall pour down
upon the land.

00:13:18.111 --> 00:13:23.845
The tremendous power found
within the Zone will be my anger.

00:13:24.817 --> 00:13:27.945
Lord Gotto, please be sure
this matter...

00:13:30.123 --> 00:13:31.557
That's obvious!

00:13:31.557 --> 00:13:33.860
If the princess were to find out
about this,

00:13:33.860 --> 00:13:36.496
that very thing would stir up
Princess Tina's emotions,

00:13:36.496 --> 00:13:38.264
and cause a terrible disaster!

00:13:38.264 --> 00:13:40.299
What have you done?!

00:13:40.299 --> 00:13:42.802
All of you! All of you!

00:13:42.802 --> 00:13:44.337
Insanity!

00:13:44.337 --> 00:13:47.540
The king's grief must, of course,
have been unimaginable but...

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:49.542
What a thing to do!

00:13:49.542 --> 00:13:52.739
Insanity! Insanity!!

00:13:53.012 --> 00:13:55.572
What did you say?

00:13:58.584 --> 00:14:00.887
I'd heard that the palace scientists
were conducting

00:14:00.887 --> 00:14:03.378
some strange experiments but...

00:14:03.956 --> 00:14:05.525
Tina, is it?

00:14:05.525 --> 00:14:07.827
Well then, that's perfect!

00:14:07.827 --> 00:14:10.261
Just watch, Titus!

00:14:12.165 --> 00:14:14.133
Soran!

00:14:16.135 --> 00:14:17.570
Soran! Soran!

00:14:17.570 --> 00:14:20.198
Tina! I'm so glad you're all right.

00:14:20.473 --> 00:14:22.338
Soran!

00:14:29.882 --> 00:14:31.284
The king has changed.

00:14:31.284 --> 00:14:34.151
He's no longer the kind and
gentle person he was before.

00:14:34.387 --> 00:14:37.089
It's no wonder.
The princess was...

00:14:37.089 --> 00:14:41.093
Stop it! At any rate, we have to hurry
and finish the control mechanism.

00:14:41.093 --> 00:14:42.261
Hesma!

00:14:42.261 --> 00:14:45.264
It's fine. I'll be able to
calibrate it soon.

00:14:45.264 --> 00:14:48.201
The Orsel control panel will have
to carefully regulate things

00:14:48.201 --> 00:14:52.297
until the operating mechanism can be
removed from Princess Tina's body.

00:14:57.977 --> 00:14:59.612
You understand, right, Tina?

00:14:59.612 --> 00:15:01.981
I think you should talk to the king.

00:15:01.981 --> 00:15:03.749
You can't let things go on like this.

00:15:03.749 --> 00:15:08.054
Yes. Though Father seems a bit tired
lately because of what happened to me.

00:15:08.054 --> 00:15:09.322
But soon...

00:15:09.322 --> 00:15:10.721
Princess...

00:15:13.826 --> 00:15:16.659
I brought this for you.

00:15:16.963 --> 00:15:18.231
What is it?

00:15:18.231 --> 00:15:20.597
It's a letter.

00:15:32.378 --> 00:15:34.778
Seth... Seth...

00:15:35.748 --> 00:15:37.079
Tina?

00:15:38.017 --> 00:15:39.885
What's the matter?! Tina!

00:15:39.885 --> 00:15:41.853
Mother...

00:15:42.588 --> 00:15:44.715
What did you say?!

00:15:45.224 --> 00:15:48.751
Tina... My Tina...

00:15:49.295 --> 00:15:52.321
Please don't be shocked
by my sudden letter.

00:15:52.965 --> 00:15:57.026
This is your shameful mother who
abandoned you when you were little.

00:15:57.403 --> 00:15:59.805
Because of a promise I made
to King Titus,

00:15:59.805 --> 00:16:02.642
I am forbidden from seeing you.

00:16:02.642 --> 00:16:05.845
But I'm so worried about the
misfortune that befell you,

00:16:05.845 --> 00:16:08.347
I'm having this letter sent to you.

00:16:08.347 --> 00:16:11.984
Tina, I want to see you,
even if only for a moment.

00:16:11.984 --> 00:16:14.748
I'm not asking you to forgive me.

00:16:15.388 --> 00:16:18.983
But I have always loved you.

00:16:20.359 --> 00:16:22.554
Please come see me.

00:16:22.995 --> 00:16:25.898
To my beloved daughter, Tina.

00:16:25.898 --> 00:16:27.559
From, Reda.

00:16:29.068 --> 00:16:31.370
Seth, do you think it's true?

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:33.172
Is Mother really?

00:16:33.172 --> 00:16:34.840
It's a malicious prank!

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:38.003
I was told that your mother
passed away a long time ago!

00:16:38.811 --> 00:16:40.513
I'm going to question that man!

00:16:40.513 --> 00:16:42.081
Wait!

00:16:42.081 --> 00:16:45.573
What if this really is a letter
from Mother?

00:16:46.218 --> 00:16:48.354
If Father finds out about this...

00:16:48.354 --> 00:16:49.522
What does it matter?!

00:16:49.522 --> 00:16:52.591
Even if it's true, she's the mother
who abandoned you,

00:16:52.591 --> 00:16:54.327
Tina!

00:16:54.327 --> 00:16:56.818
Please, Seth.

00:17:01.133 --> 00:17:03.669
But this might be a trap.

00:17:03.669 --> 00:17:05.660
Please.

00:17:07.206 --> 00:17:10.710
I understand, Tina.
And I'll go with you.

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:13.235
Thank you, Seth.

00:17:22.655 --> 00:17:24.056
Lord Gueroca!

00:17:24.056 --> 00:17:26.492
Is this the Tanatulum?

00:17:26.492 --> 00:17:29.795
I'm very sorry,
but I can't let you in here.

00:17:29.795 --> 00:17:31.786
Please go back.

00:17:35.067 --> 00:17:36.369
It's done!

00:17:36.369 --> 00:17:40.032
Now it should be possible to control
the Orsel coming from the Zone.

00:17:42.408 --> 00:17:43.976
Lord Gueroca?

00:17:43.976 --> 00:17:45.711
Is there something?

00:17:45.711 --> 00:17:48.805
So that is Tina's control mechanism?

00:17:49.682 --> 00:17:51.150
What are you talking about?

00:17:51.150 --> 00:17:53.812
You're going to come
with me for a bit.

00:17:55.221 --> 00:17:57.823
No matter how powerful
the weapon,

00:17:57.823 --> 00:18:01.259
if you can't control it, it's useless.

00:18:01.894 --> 00:18:04.363
As a scientist,
this should interest you.

00:18:04.363 --> 00:18:09.767
Don't you want to know how
your creation performs, Hesma?

00:18:59.151 --> 00:19:00.778
Tina!

00:19:02.254 --> 00:19:04.123
You came!

00:19:04.123 --> 00:19:06.859
You've become so grown up
and beautiful!

00:19:06.859 --> 00:19:09.061
Are you feeling better now?

00:19:09.061 --> 00:19:12.895
I was worried when I heard
there was an accident at the palace.

00:19:18.471 --> 00:19:22.208
She's fine now. As you can see,
Princess Tina has recovered.

00:19:22.208 --> 00:19:25.268
You're Seth, aren't you?

00:19:25.578 --> 00:19:28.280
You know me?

00:19:28.280 --> 00:19:30.549
I remember that from the time
Tina was born,

00:19:30.549 --> 00:19:35.721
you always stayed by her side
and would never leave her.

00:19:35.721 --> 00:19:38.690
You've grown into a fine
young man, haven't you?

00:19:39.291 --> 00:19:42.260
And I've heard that your
wedding is forthcoming.

00:19:44.630 --> 00:19:47.121
You really are Mother, aren't you?

00:19:47.266 --> 00:19:51.604
Father told me that my mother
had passed away.

00:19:51.604 --> 00:19:53.435
Why?

00:19:57.576 --> 00:19:59.612
Please forgive me.

00:19:59.612 --> 00:20:03.013
I... I...

00:20:03.682 --> 00:20:06.752
When you're seeing your daughter
for the first time in 13 years,

00:20:06.752 --> 00:20:09.414
there shouldn't be tears, Reda!

00:20:15.294 --> 00:20:17.922
Lord Gueroca!
Why are you here?

00:20:22.334 --> 00:20:25.064
You told me you wouldn't
come here.

00:20:28.307 --> 00:20:30.209
What is the meaning of this?

00:20:30.209 --> 00:20:33.212
Stop it!
Get out of here immediately!

00:20:33.212 --> 00:20:38.117
Reda, is that any way to talk to
your husband?

00:20:38.117 --> 00:20:40.019
-Husband?!
-Yes.

00:20:40.019 --> 00:20:42.421
This is my beloved wife, Seth.

00:20:42.421 --> 00:20:45.117
Though I've always kept it hidden.

00:20:46.992 --> 00:20:49.161
Right after the queen
gave birth to Tina,

00:20:49.161 --> 00:20:52.264
she ran to me,
the younger brother.

00:20:52.264 --> 00:20:55.100
Stop it! Stop!

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:58.871
Don't get so excited.
You'll hurt the child you're carrying.

00:20:58.871 --> 00:21:01.340
We both hate the king.

00:21:01.340 --> 00:21:03.142
I do not.

00:21:03.142 --> 00:21:05.133
I don't.

00:21:07.079 --> 00:21:10.276
But I didn't expect his daughter to
become the victim in his stead.

00:21:10.683 --> 00:21:13.083
My older brother has the
luck of the devil.

00:21:13.852 --> 00:21:16.355
It can't be!
You planted the bomb?!

00:21:16.355 --> 00:21:17.185
You?!

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:20.159
Don't raise your voice!

00:21:20.159 --> 00:21:22.992
Look, the princess is frightened.

00:21:23.395 --> 00:21:26.853
No, the thing that looks like
the princess.

00:21:27.766 --> 00:21:30.235
She's truly even better than
the real thing.

00:21:30.235 --> 00:21:32.371
Didn't you think it was strange, Tina?

00:21:32.371 --> 00:21:35.808
You were in an accident so terrible
it destroyed the whole royal chamber,

00:21:35.808 --> 00:21:38.677
and you survived it without
a single scratch.

00:21:38.677 --> 00:21:40.779
Let me enlighten you.

00:21:40.779 --> 00:21:44.083
Tina died then, in that explosion.

00:21:44.083 --> 00:21:45.985
The Tina here,

00:21:45.985 --> 00:21:47.620
is a doll that the palace scientists

00:21:47.620 --> 00:21:50.612
brought back to life using
artificial matter!

00:21:50.689 --> 00:21:53.058
And by order of the king,

00:21:53.058 --> 00:21:56.585
she's a monster with an all-powerful
weapon implanted inside her!

00:21:57.863 --> 00:22:00.265
You bastard!
Have you lost your mind?

00:22:00.265 --> 00:22:02.893
Things like that are impossible!

00:22:03.602 --> 00:22:05.126
Look!

00:22:13.012 --> 00:22:15.714
When I woke up,

00:22:15.714 --> 00:22:18.817
that man was beside me.

00:22:18.817 --> 00:22:20.478
That man...

00:22:36.602 --> 00:22:46.204
At the bottom of a deep
shimmering sea,

00:22:46.679 --> 00:22:55.951
A tiny flower rests,

00:22:56.555 --> 00:23:05.793
A sweet wind's even sweeter song
passes through a rainbow,

00:23:06.532 --> 00:23:15.607
And fish, rising from the bottom,
seem to flutter on the horizon.

00:23:15.607 --> 00:23:20.579
Everyone is singing love's melody,

00:23:20.579 --> 00:23:25.784
A warm light streams from the sky,

00:23:25.784 --> 00:23:30.889
And the sun's yellow gaze,
unbound and full,

00:23:30.889 --> 00:23:39.490
Is wrapped in the arms of the sea.
